  "description": "Ju-Gyeong is a powerhouse Chief Producer who has never felt a single spark of true love. But her life shatters when a rogue celestial’s forbidden arrow strikes her by mistake. Consumed by a supernatural fever, she stumbles into the arms of Hyeon-U. One look at him is all it takes for the curse to ignite, forcing a desperate confession to a total stranger. Now, Ju-Gyeong must navigate a cutthroat industry and a vengeful executive director. In a world where a cold heart leads to a cold grave, can she turn a forced obsession into a love worth living for?\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
